{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3f2c9b8a993364c7e580e8b620b92958ff48fb1a47b008a33419e0bae9e03cd6", "ja": "風花、ブログ読んだよ。\n衣装、気に入ってくれたみたいで良かった。", "zh": "风花，我看过你的博客了。看起来你很喜欢这套服装，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d24dd5d61141db328fe9e9d4d3b6b308013af2ccc89e78e0f24479131ba872f8", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん。\n可愛い衣装で、すごく気に入っちゃいました！", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生。\n这套可爱的服装，我特别喜欢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "182096e115abc2f0057cf58b68eb0108683b54a6dcdf25e9dd8548722ee86501", "ja": "それに、落ち着いた雰囲気もあって……\nとっても清楚な感じがしますよね！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "而且还有种沉稳的氛围……感觉特别清纯呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ea0f61a9b78df4a644da19564bec0f140cf45e6e00d9cc5ceaddb6cb7db6421f", "ja": "ああ、ばっちり似合ってるよ。レトロな感じで。\n美味しいコーヒーを淹れてくれそうだ。", "zh": "啊，非常合适。很有复古风格。\n感觉你会泡出很好喝的咖啡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b9ff666f775e207f261eebff7d2bafa8a95f50052c4e8d4f40dd8cc3b7eb11a1", "ja": "そうですか？　よかった……♪\nコーヒーくらいなら、いつでも淹れますけど。", "zh": "是吗？那就太好了……♪\n如果只是咖啡的话，我随时都可以泡给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d4b75f796c90f80b93b71d425c017883940bac8064ac3d92c85a1d2b96fe5269", "ja": "あ、でも……こういう店員さんが働く\nお店って、きっと本格的なコーヒーですよね。", "zh": "啊，不过……有这种店员工作的店，咖啡肯定很讲究吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "73e72c5955f4f5d1a7bf9e4b79f2b0039c77716faaef925a4d8ec84c7fef3210", "ja": "ちゃんと淹れられるかな……。そもそも私、\nレトロな喫茶店ってそこまで詳しくないんですよね。", "zh": "能好好泡出来吗……说起来，我对复古咖啡馆也没那么了解。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1007_p", "source_sha256": "cd6ea4356a108c705aa2a25b48261a9aaf52782476e483f4c2d316026b18cfde", "ja": "いやいや、淹れてくれるだけで十分ありがたいよ。\nそれはともかく、レトロな世界観って独特だよな。", "zh": "别这么说，光是愿意帮我泡就已经很感谢了。\n先不说这个，复古的世界观还真是挺特别的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "07998bab2cab8ee52a0a5d61c6e00f83c0ae1600d6f898dc7a437cf9cb4b5b9b", "ja": "時代によっては、店員さん\n目当てのお客さんも多かったらしい。", "zh": "听说在某些年代，也有很多客人是冲着店员来的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "862bb21bd1b78de745fe98d0d19f5171f0e56574dc749e096bd3e4bd9d5649fe", "ja": "そうなんですね。こんなに可愛い服で給仕されたら、\n常連さんができるのも、なんかわかるかも。", "zh": "原来如此。要是有人穿着这么可爱的服装来招待，能有熟客也就不难理解了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "95cd686c37efccffb8c63ff79d94fdc2dc2af71b92e17f4b0638828a9e887d62", "ja": "あっ。それって、なんだかファンの人達みたい。\n私達に会いに劇場に来てくれるのと似てますね。", "zh": "啊。这么一想，总觉得有点像粉丝呢。\n就像他们为了见我们而来到剧场一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1011_p", "source_sha256": "ac11e35b90f514931ae2b203e210a4a75a0b649abf67a0b21b40bf4267375066", "ja": "確かに。店員さんはその頃の、\nアイドルみたいな存在だったのかもな。", "zh": "确实。那时候的店员，\n说不定就像偶像一样的存在呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "cfa2ea2a5030ab80bdc922e2999b8ee0943f2806a3d09acfb5ce8af73dfc982f", "ja": "そう考えると、改めて風花にぴったりな衣装だな。\nうん、作って良かったよ！", "zh": "这么一想，这套服装果然很适合风花啊。\n嗯，做出来真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5adaea77324447c9a31a1aaf71d00fe0a6ded47ad229b0c6975cc2f73c5c6e67", "ja": "ふふっ。私もその時代に生まれていたら、\nこういう店員さんをしていたかもしれませんね。", "zh": "呵呵。如果我也出生在那个时代，说不定也会成为这样的店员呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a0ab9e36adbc8d2575f3634f399c13cf0b8932d7ed50107c730ba9860aa61b54", "ja": "もし私が、喫茶店で働いていたら……。\n毎日、会いに来てくれますか？", "zh": "如果我在咖啡厅工作的话……\n您会每天都来看我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ddaa6c3bebaa52c1bb094b2b8756d10a8c156299b9ae512ac58fe47a8e20550d", "ja": "そりゃ、こんなに可愛い店員さんがいるなら、\n一日中いると思うよ。", "zh": "那当然，要是有这么可爱的店员在，我肯定会待上一整天。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f18d87ced6cac0363d40e00c30634eafcd77d9316dd380116f597a4df962e6bf", "ja": "か、可愛いって……ふふっ。そんなお客さんが\nいてくれたら、こっちも張り合いがあります♪", "zh": "可、可爱什么的……呵呵。要是有这样的客人愿意光顾，我们也会更有干劲呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9fc499cda90dd09816838168ea2b7f8fff5d4004dfa73822bd6cc7fda50ad849", "ja": "って、私、なんだか大胆な事聞いちゃったかも……？\nうぅ、は、恥ずかしい……！", "zh": "啊，我是不是问了什么大胆的问题啊……？呜，好、好羞人……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1018_p", "source_sha256": "90e7523e3831122f68d6e9c8597b37ec1be94e7f54a88330bbd527ab8bfb9522", "ja": "えっ、今さら恥ずかしがる事ないんじゃ……。\nとっくに俺は、風花のファンなわけだし。", "zh": "诶，都到这份上了，就没必要害羞了吧……\n我早就是风花的粉丝了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2150f29b579912848c1e785498db1adafc5eed6dc9bc755d6e8f4b81a1811c4a", "ja": "そういうのが恥ずかしいんですっ！　も、もう……。\nコーヒー淹れてきますから、少し落ち着きましょう！", "zh": "就是因为这样才让人害羞嘛！真、真是的……\n我去泡咖啡，先稍微冷静一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_041fuk0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_041fuk0234_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9ab0155081960d59c6b82e92a428ffe07a67241be3ce63ba1db19e0b411f301b", "ja": "あっ、風花、着替えてから行かないと。\nそれは一応、衣装だから……おーい！", "zh": "啊，风花，你得换好衣服再去。\n那好歹也是演出服……喂——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
